      "en": "I'll prove it",
      "zh": "證明給你看"
    },
    {
      "ja": "ちょっと聞いて！私",
      "romaji": "Chotto Kiite! Watashi",
      "en": "Hey, listen! I—",
      "zh": "聽我說！我啊"
    },
    {
      "ja": "気づいちゃったかも",
      "romaji": "Kizuitchatta Kamo",
      "en": "I might have realized something",
      "zh": "好像已經察覺到了"
    },
    {
      "ja": "恋は=(イコール)じゃ括れないわ",
      "romaji": "Koi ha Ikooru ja Kukurenai wa",
      "en": "Love can't be summed up with an equal sign",
      "zh": "戀愛是無法用等號概括的"
